WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.317
Replace the letter with the given number, then use the order of operations.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:12.577
Evaluate 2n plus 8 if n equals 8. The answer is 24. Substitute n equals 8 to obtain 2

00:00:12.577 --> 00:00:14.907
times 8 plus 8 equals 24.

00:00:15.783 --> 00:00:21.762
A display at a school fair uses rule 9n plus 8. What is the display when n equals 2?

00:00:21.762 --> 00:00:23.335
Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:30.888
A display at a school fair uses rule 9n plus 8. What is the display when n equals 2?

00:00:30.888 --> 00:00:36.872
The answer is 26. Substitute n equals 2 to obtain 9 times 2 plus 8 equals 26.
